{"id":"dd1054640a87945d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/013_单子一阶逻辑.md","title":"013 单子一阶逻辑","display":"013_单子一阶逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始数据\">1. 原始数据</h1>\n<p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一元谓词符号集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\{P_i:i\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P=\\{P_i:i\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span> 的元数固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pred}_1=\\mathcal P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Pred}_1=\\mathcal P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span> 是同一类型条件。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{mon},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{mon},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统不含二元及更高元关系符号、不含函数符号、不含等号。</p>\n<p>原始数据记录定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Data}_{Mon}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal P,\n\\operatorname{mon},\n\\mathsf{Var}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Data}_{Mon}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal P,\n\\operatorname{mon},\n\\mathsf{Var}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子公式形成子句只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 组成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>项集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单子原子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}_{Mon}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{mon}(P,x):P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{At}_{Mon}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{mon}(P,x):P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义变量替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=y]=\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon}(A,x,y)\">\\(A[x:=y]=\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon}(A,x,y)\\)</span>。原子子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mon}(P,z)[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{mon}(P,y),&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{mon}(P,z),&amp;z\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mon}(P,z)[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{mon}(P,y),&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{mon}(P,z),&amp;z\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>否定和蕴含子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=y],B[x:=y]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=y],B[x:=y]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A)\\quad(z=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A)\\quad(z=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A[x:=y])\\quad(z\\ne x,\\ z\\ne y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(z,A[x:=y])\\quad(z\\ne x,\\ z\\ne y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\ne x\">\\(z\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=y\">\\(z=y\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(w,(A[z:=w])[x:=y]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}(z,A)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{all}(w,(A[z:=w])[x:=y]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为下列关系族的交集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{Mon}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{Mon}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{Mon}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{Mon}\\)</span> 是所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x),\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{mon}(P,x),\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"5\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol start=\"6\">\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则生成对</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}\n\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=y])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}\n\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=y])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>属于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal E_{Mon}\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal E_{Mon}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理与规则\">4. 公理与规则</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=y]:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=y]:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}=\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}=\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明与可证性\">5. 证明与可证性</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，至少满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>可证性记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\\)</span> 由下节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明行许可、可证性与目标区分\">6. 证明行许可、可证性与目标区分</h1>\n<p>定义证明行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\)</span> 且满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\">\\(\\pi(i)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}\">\\(((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}\">\\(((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明对象集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是可证性关系满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\\,\nA_{m-1}=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon}(\\Gamma)\\,\nA_{m-1}=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义原子判别与目标差异谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atom}_{Mon}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\nA=\\operatorname{mon}(P,x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Atom}_{Mon}(A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\nA=\\operatorname{mon}(P,x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Mon}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{At}_{Mon}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{mon}(P,x):P\\in\\mathcal P,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\,\\forall A\\,\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{Mon}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{At}_{Mon}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{mon}(P,x):P\\in\\mathcal P,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\,\\forall A\\,\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{Mon}A\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条件排除多元关系原子、函数项和等号原子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个形式系统\">7. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MonFO}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathcal P,\n\\mathsf{Pred}_1,\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{At}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon},\n\\operatorname{Atom}_{Mon},\n\\Delta_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon},\n\\vdash_{Mon}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MonFO}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathcal P,\n\\mathsf{Pred}_1,\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{At}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{Mon},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Mon},\n\\operatorname{Atom}_{Mon},\n\\Delta_{Mon},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Mon},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{Mon},\n\\vdash_{Mon}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含单子谓词原子、变量替换、量词、Hilbert 证明对象和可证性关系；不含多元关系、函数、等号、结构解释或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始数据","text":"1. 原始数据","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理与规则","text":"4. 公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明与可证性","text":"5. 证明与可证性","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明行许可、可证性与目标区分","text":"6. 证明行许可、可证性与目标区分","level":1},{"id":"7.-整个形式系统","text":"7. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,","display":true},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\{P_i:i\\in I\\}","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Pred}_1=\\mathcal P.","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{mon},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Data}_{Mon}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal P,\n\\operatorname{mon},\n\\mathsf{Var}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{Mon}=\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}_{Mon}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{mon}(P,x):P\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_1,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mon}(P,x)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\{x\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Mon}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Mon}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{mon}(P,x))=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Mon}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=